@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Raw observations + freshness;
:State / Eligibility\n(active, eligible, reason, block reason, Fast state);
:Calculation provenance\n(branch, time profile + target share, semantics, physical reference,\ncandidates, shares/capture, target_selected_by);
:Target stages\nraw -> limit -> smoothing -> ramp -> B -> O -> cross-charge -> final;
:Result fields\ntarget_final_reason/control_reason + technical path + mode + limiters;
:Command evidence\nintent, readback, lifecycle, effect/resync;
